---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Legal Notice">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-base-800 dark:text-white">Legal Notice</h1>
    </header>

    <h2>Community names, logos, and trademarks</h2>
    <p>
      The names, logos, and other trademarks of the communities listed on this
      site belong to their respective owners. They are shown here for
      identification purposes only, so that each community can be recognized
      on its listing. Their use does not imply ownership by, endorsement of,
      or affiliation with this website.
    </p>

    <h2>Community descriptions and content</h2>
    <p>
      This site is an open directory: anyone can submit a community by
      opening a pull request on <a href="https://github.com/cmaureir/python-communities">GitHub</a>.
      Contributors are not required to be official representatives of the
      community they submit, so an entry's presence here does not mean the
      community itself maintains or endorses it. The website authors do not
      claim copyright over community descriptions, logos, or any other
      community-specific content included this way.
    </p>

    <h2>Corrections and removal</h2>
    <p>
      If you represent a community listed here and something is inaccurate,
      outdated, or you'd like it removed, please open an issue or pull
      request on the <a href="https://github.com/cmaureir/python-communities">GitHub repository</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
